&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environmental Data Collection:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect environmental, operational, and material-related data from various departments across the company. Coordinate and follow up on data requests with Engineering, Procurement, Manufacturing, Facilities, and Supply Chain teams. Support the establishment of efficient environmental data collection processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Validation &amp;amp; Preparation:&lt;/strong&gt; Review, validate, and organize collected datasets. Ensure data consistency, completeness, and traceability. Structure environmental datasets according to LCA requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
