&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And increasingly important:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively use AI tools (e.g. Claude Code, Cursor) to accelerate and improve your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset of automation and leverage - looking for ways to scale your impact beyond one-off analyses&lt;/li&gt;
