&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This is not a live vacancy. We are hiring ahead of demand and building a talent pipeline for upcoming client engagements. By applying, you&#39;re expressing interest in future opportunities, and we&#39;ll be in touch as soon as a matching role becomes available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Data Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role and team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on delivery engineers working under the Architect to execute data migrations. Responsible for building and fixing data pipelines, resolving technical debt, and getting platforms to a stable, production-ready state.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and optimise data pipelines on the AWS stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve existing technical debt in migrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with client engineering teams to transfer knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to stabilising platforms and hitting delivery milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Architect in defining and implementing the target state&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We&#39;d love to talk to you if you have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the AWS data stack: S3, Glue, Redshift, Lake Formation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Lakehouse patterns and architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Python and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated or high-volume data environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Betting and/or gaming domain knowledge required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
